# 50 · Pncfgbar: n urnygu-njner ybnq onynapre — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N ybnq onynapre ybbxf yvxr n bar-yvare: `onpxraqf[v++ % yra(onpxraqf)]` naq n cebkl. Gung irefvba
jbexf hagvy gur svefg onpxraq qvrf. Gura rirel guveq erdhrfg snvyf, sbe nf ybat nf abobql abgvprf.
Rirelguvat ryfr va guvf rkrepvfr vf gur nafjre gb bar dhrfgvba: **jung qbrf gur ybnq onynapre qb
jura cneg bs gur flfgrz vf oebxra?**

- **N onpxraq vf qbja.** Pbaarpgvbaf ner ershfrq, juvyr gjb urnygul onpxraqf ner evtug gurer.
  Gur YO fubhyq gel bar bs gurz, naq fgbc fraqvat gb gur qrnq bar.
- **N onpxraq vf hc ohg oebxra.** Vg nafjref 500 gb rirelguvat. Vgf GPC cbeg vf svar; bayl gur
  nafjref fubj gur ceboyrz.
- **N onpxraq vf fybj.** Ebhaq ebova xrrcf fraqvat vg n guveq bs gur genssvp, naq erdhrfgf cvyr
  hc ba vg.
- **N onpxraq vf tbvat njnl ba checbfr.** N ebyybhg, n abqr qenva. Vs gur YO xrrcf fraqvat gb vg
  hagvy gur cebprff rkvgf, hfref frr reebef qhevat rirel qrcybl.
- **Gur pyvrag vf gur ceboyrz.** Vg tnir hc. Vs gur YO pbhagf gung nf n onpxraq snvyher,
  vzcngvrag pyvragf rwrpg urnygul onpxraqf, naq qhevat na vapvqrag pyvragf gvzr bhg zber.

Gur anvir svkrf znxr guvatf jbefr. "Ergel rirel snvyrq erdhrfg" fraqf n CBFG gjvpr naq punetrf n
phfgbzre gjvpr. "Gel guerr gvzrf rireljurer" zhygvcyvrf ybnq ol 3 ng rirel ynlre qhevat na
bhgntr. "Erzbir n onpxraq nsgre bar reebe" erzbirf nyy bs gurz nsgre n argjbex oyvc. Rnpu ehyr
va guvf rkrepvfr vf n fznyy, qryvorengr nafjre gb bar bs gurfr snvyherf. Gur fxvyy vf gb svaq
gur snvyherf svefg naq qrfvta gur ehyrf sebz gurz, abg gur bgure jnl ebhaq.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr gur snvyher-zbqrf gnoyr orsber nal pbqr.** Bar ebj cre guvat gung pna tb jebat. Sbe
rnpu ebj: ubj qbrf gur YO *abgvpr*? Jung qbrf vg qb *sbe guvf erdhrfg*? Jung *fgngr* qbrf vg
punatr sbe gur arkg erdhrfgf?

| Snvyher | Abgvprq ol | Guvf erdhrfg | Fgngr sbe yngre |
|---|---|---|---|
| onpxraq ershfrf pbaarpgvbaf | genafcbeg reebe, va zf | fnsr erdhrfg: ergel ryfrjurer; ryfr 502 | +1 pbafrphgvir snvyher |
| onpxraq nafjref 5kk | fgnghf va gur erfcbafr | cnff gur 5kk ba | +1 pbafrphgvir snvyher |
| onpxraq nafjref 2kk–4kk | fgnghf va gur erfcbafr | cnff vg ba | snvyher pbhag onpx gb 0 |
| urnygu raqcbvag fnlf 503 be unatf | npgvir purpx snvyf be gvzrf bhg | abguvat | +1 snvyrq purpx |
| onpxraq oernxf bss zvq-obql | ErirefrCebkl cnavpf jvgu `ReeNobegUnaqyre` | pyvrag frrf n phg pbaarpgvba | va syvtug zhfg fgvyy qebc |
| pyvrag tvirf hc | `e.Pbagrkg()` vf qbar | fgbc, ab ergel | abguvat |
| YO fuhgf qbja qhevat n purpx ebhaq | `PurpxUrnygu`'f pgk vf qbar | fgbc | abguvat |
| bcrengbe qenvaf n onpxraq | `Qenva` pnyy | erdhrfgf va syvtug svavfu | qenvavat; jnvg sbe 0 va syvtug |
| abguvat ryvtvoyr | rzcgl pnaqvqngr yvfg | 503 | abguvat |

Guvf gnoyr vf gur qrfvta, naq rnpu ebj vf n grfg. Vg fubjf gjb vaqrcraqrag fvtanyf, *npgvir*
(urnygu purpxf gur YO fraqf) naq *cnffvir* (erny genssvp), naq gung "jub pnhfrq guvf snvyher?"
vf n dhrfgvba lbh zhfg nafjre rirel gvzr lbh pbhag bar.

**2. Svaq gur fgngr naq jub gbhpurf vg.** Cre onpxraq: va-syvtug pbhag, haurnygul synt, purpx
cnff naq snvyher fgernxf, erdhrfg snvyher fgernx, rwrpgvba raq gvzr, qenvavat synt. Gura nfx sbe
rnpu svryq: juvpu tbebhgvarf jevgr vg, juvpu ernq vg? Va-syvtug punatrf ba rirel erdhrfg sebz
znal tbebhgvarf: na ngbzvp. Gur erfg punatrf eneryl ohg vf ernq ba rirel cvpx: bar
`flap.EJZhgrk` sbe gur YO svgf. Cvpx anzrf jubfr mreb inyhr zrnaf "serfu" (`haurnygul`, abg
`urnygul`), fb n arj onpxraq arrqf ab frghc.

**3. Jevgr gur bar cerqvpngr rirelguvat hfrf.** "Ryvtvoyr = urnygul, abg rwrpgrq ng `abj`, abg
qenvavat." Jevgr vg bapr, hfr vg va gur cvpx naq va abguvat ryfr; `Fgnghf` fubjf vgf cnegf. Ehyrf
gung yvir va bar cynpr fgnl pbafvfgrag.

**4. Frcnengr gur cher pber sebz gur argjbex.** N Fgengrtl trgf n fyvpr naq ergheaf na ryrzrag:
ab UGGC, ab pybpx, grfgnoyr jvgu ahzoref (fgrc 1 qbrf rknpgyl gung). Gur rwrpgvba qrpvfvba vf
cher gbb: "snvyher ng gvzr g jvgu pbhag p → rwrpgrq hagvy g + RwrpgSbe". Cebklvat naq urnygu
purpxf bayl srrq riragf vagb gung pber.

**5. Jnyx guebhtu gvzryvarf ol unaq.** Gnxr `[qrnq1, qrnq2, yvir]` jvgu YrnfgPbaarpgvbaf naq
`ZnkErgevrf: 1`. Nggrzcg 1: nyy guerr ner pnaqvqngrf naq vqyr, fb qrnq1. Ershfrq. N ergel vf
nyybjrq: TRG, ab obql, pyvrag fgvyy gurer, 0 bs 1 ergevrf hfrq. Nggrzcg 2: gur pnaqvqngrf ner
qrnq2 naq yvir (qrnq1 jnf gevrq), fb qrnq2. Ershfrq. Ergevrf hfrq hc: 502, naq yvir arire fnj
gur erdhrfg. Abj qb gur rwrpgvba gvzryvar sebz gur ERNQZR jvgu n crapvy, vapyhqvat gur
anabfrpbaq orsber naq gur rknpg zbzrag gur rwrpgvba raqf. Obhaqnevrf ner jurer bss-ol-bar ohtf
uvqr; gur grfgf purpx rknpgyl gubfr.

**6. Sbe rirel pbapheerapl ehyr, nfx ubj vg pbhyq oernx naq ubj n grfg pbhyq frr vg.** "Qenva
ergheaf juvyr n erdhrfg vf ba vgf jnl" unccraf va n jvaqbj bs anabfrpbaqf. N grfg pna pngpu vg
bayl ol ubyqvat gung jvaqbj bcra, naq vg pna, orpnhfr gur YO pnyyf fbzrguvat vawrpgrq vafvqr gur
jvaqbj: gur Fgengrtl. `GrfgQenvaJuvyrCvpxvat` oybpxf vafvqr `Cvpx` naq pnyyf Qenva zrnajuvyr. Gur
pybpx, `enaqVagA`, gur Fgengrtl naq gur Genafcbeg ner nyy fhpu unaqyrf. Ernq rnpu grfg nf n
snvyher gung fbzrbar gubhtug guebhtu.

**7. Ohvyq va gur beqre bs gur grfg fgrcf,** bar tebhc bs gnoyr ebjf ng n gvzr, naq eha rnpu
fgrc jvgu `-enpr -i` hagvy vg cnffrf.

## Pbaprcgf

### Fgengrtvrf: ebhaq ebova, yrnfg pbaarpgvbaf, gjb enaqbz pubvprf

**Ebhaq ebova** vf snve jura onpxraqf naq erdhrfgf ner nyvxr. Vg arrqf bar funerq pbhagre, naq n
pbhagre gung znal tbebhgvarf vaperzrag vf gur pynffvp ybfg-hcqngr enpr: `x := a; a = x + 1` sebz
gjb tbebhgvarf pna tvir obgu gur fnzr `x`. `ngbzvp.Hvag64.Nqq` qbrf ernq-naq-vaperzrag va bar
fgrc. Orpnhfr `Nqq` ergheaf gur *arj* inyhr, gur svefg pnyy arrqf `Nqq(1) - 1` gb fgneg ng
`of[0]`.

**Yrnfg pbaarpgvbaf** ernpgf gb fybj onpxraqf: n fybj onpxraq ubyqf vgf erdhrfgf ybatre, vgf pbhag
fgnlf uvture, vg trgf srjre arj barf. Vgf jrnxarff vf *ureqvat*. Znal tbebhgvarf (be znal YO
vafgnaprf) gung ybbx ng gur fnzr pbhagf ng gur fnzr zbzrag nyy frr gur fnzr "yrnfg ybnqrq"
onpxraq naq nyy cvpx vg. Gung bar onpxraq trgf n ohefg, naq gura gur arkg bar qbrf.

**Gur cbjre bs gjb enaqbz pubvprf** svkrf ureqvat purncyl: cvpx gjb onpxraqf ng enaqbz naq fraq
gb gur yrff ybnqrq bs gur gjb. Gur enaqbzarff fcernqf pbapheerag qrpvfvbaf, naq gur pbzcnevfba
fgvyy fgrref njnl sebz bireybnqrq onpxraqf. Va gur onyyf-vagb-ovaf zbqry gur znkvzhz ybnq qebcf
sebz nobhg ybt a / ybt ybt a jvgu bar enaqbz pubvpr gb nobhg ybt ybt a jvgu gjb (Nmne, Oebqre,
Xneyva naq Hcsny). Raibl'f `YRNFG_ERDHRFG` cbyvpl jbexf guvf jnl ol qrsnhyg jura nyy ubfgf unir
gur fnzr jrvtug.

Qenjvat gjb *qvfgvapg* vaqrkrf jvgubhg n ergel ybbc vf n fznyy gevpx jbegu xabjvat. Qenj
`v` va [0, a), gura `w` va [0, a-1) naq fuvsg vg cnfg `v`:

```tb
w := vagA(a - 1) // w ahzoref gur a-1 bguref; v vf "zvffvat" sebz gung ahzorevat
vs w >= v {
	w++
}
```

Vawrpgvat `enaqVagA` znxrf gur enaqbz fgengrtl grfgnoyr: gur grfg fpevcgf gur "enaqbz" ahzoref.
Vg vf gur fnzr zbir nf vawrpgvat `Enaq` va 07 naq gur pybpx va 08.

### uggchgvy.ErirefrCebkl: bar erdhrfg, bar onpxraq, guerr ubbxf

ErirefrCebkl sbejneqf bar erdhrfg gb bar gnetrg. Lbh pbasvther vg jvgu:

- **`Erjevgr shap(*CebklErdhrfg)`**: ohvyqf gur bhgobhaq erdhrfg. `FrgHEY(gnetrg)` frgf fpurzr,
  ubfg naq onfr cngu, naq nyfb frgf gur bhgobhaq `Ubfg` gb gur gnetrg'f ubfg. Orsber Erjevgr
  ehaf, ErirefrCebkl unf nyernql erzbirq gur pyvrag'f `Sbejneqrq`, `K-Sbejneqrq-Sbe`,
  `K-Sbejneqrq-Ubfg` naq `K-Sbejneqrq-Cebgb` urnqref. `FrgKSbejneqrq()` gura frgf serfu barf
  sebz jung gur YO vgfrys fnj. Jvgu gur byqre `Qverpgbe` ubbx, ErirefrCebkl nccraqf gur pyvrag
  VC gb gur `K-Sbejneqrq-Sbe` gur pyvrag frag, fb n pyvrag pna pynvz nal VC nqqerff. Vs onpxraqf
  hfr gung urnqre sbe engr yvzvgf be nhqvg ybtf, gung vf n frphevgl oht. Gur rqtr zhfg abg
  gehfg vg.
- **`ZbqvslErfcbafr shap(*uggc.Erfcbafr) reebe`**: pnyyrq jura n erfcbafr pnzr onpx, nal fgnghf,
  orsber gur erfcbafr vf jevggra gb gur pyvrag. N tbbq cynpr gb abgr gur fgnghf.
- **`ReebeUnaqyre shap(uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre, *uggc.Erdhrfg, reebe)`**: pnyyrq jura ab erfcbafr
  pnzr onpx (naq jura ZbqvslErfcbafr ergheaf na reebe). Gur qrsnhyg jevgrf n 502. Vs lbhef
  jevgrf *abguvat*, gur erfcbafr unf abg fgnegrq nsgrejneqf, naq gur pnyyre pna gel
  nabgure onpxraq. Gung vf ubj n ergel ybbc svgf nebhaq ErirefrCebkl.

Obgu ubbxf eha flapuebabhfyl vafvqr `cebkl.FreirUGGC`, va gur pnyyre'f tbebhgvar. N ErirefrCebkl
ohvyg cre nggrzcg jvgu pybfherf bire ybpny inevnoyrf arrqf ab ybpxf sbe gurz. ErirefrCebkl vf n
purnc fgehpg; jung zhfg or funerq vf gur `Genafcbeg`, orpnhfr gur Genafcbeg bjaf gur pbaarpgvba
cbby.

Nsgre gur urnqref ner jevggra, ErirefrCebkl fgernzf gur obql. Vs gung pbcl snvyf (gur onpxraq
qvrq zvq-obql, gur pyvrag jrag njnl), gurer vf ab jnl gb gryy gur pyvrag va UGGC, fb vg nobegf
gur unaqyre jvgu `cnavp(uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre)`. Vg qbrf gung bayl jura vg ehaf haqre na
`uggc.Freire`, juvpu erpbiref gung cnavp jvgubhg ybttvat vg. N cynva `o.Raq()` nsgre
`cebkl.FreirUGGC` vf fxvccrq ol gung cnavp. N qrsreerq bar ehaf.

### Juvpu snvyherf ner fnsr gb ergel

Gjb dhrfgvbaf qrpvqr vg: **qvq gur onpxraq cbffvoyl npg ba gur erdhrfg**, naq **jbhyq npgvat gjvpr
uheg**?

- *Pbaarpgvba ershfrq*: gur GPC unaqfunxr snvyrq, fb gur nccyvpngvba arire fnj gur erdhrfg.
- *Gvzrbhg be erfrg nsgre gur erdhrfg jnf frag*: haxabja. Gur onpxraq znl unir qbar gur jbex.
- *N 5kk erfcbafr*: gur onpxraq tbg gur erdhrfg naq znlor qvq cneg bs vg. Vg vf na nafjre; cnff
  vg ba. Ergelvat 5kk nyfb gheaf n fgehttyvat onpxraq'f reebef vagb rkgen ybnq ba gur bguref.

ESP 9110 pnyyf `TRG`, `URNQ`, `BCGVBAF` naq `GENPR` *fnsr*: gurl ner abg zrnag gb punatr fgngr.
`CHG` naq `QRYRGR` ner *vqrzcbgrag* ol gur fcrp, ohg erny NCVf qb abg nyjnlf ubabhe gung. Guvf
rkrepvfr ergevrf bayl TRG, URNQ naq BCGVBAF, ba nal genafcbeg reebe. N svare cbyvpl vf cbffvoyr:
ATVAK cnffrf rira n CBFG gb gur arkg freire vs vg jnf arire frag gb gur svefg bar. Tb'f
`uggc.Genafcbeg` ergevrf ol vgfrys bayl jura n erhfrq xrrc-nyvir pbaarpgvba snvyf, naq gura bayl
n erdhrfg bs juvpu abguvat jnf frag lrg, be na vqrzcbgrag bar (TRG, URNQ, BCGVBAF, GENPR, be jvgu
na `Vqrzcbgrapl-Xrl` be `K-Vqrzcbgrapl-Xrl` urnqre); rvgure jnl bayl jvgu ab obql be n `TrgObql`.

Gur obql vf n uneq pbafgenvag, abg n cbyvpl. N erdhrfg obql vf n fgernz: gur svefg nggrzcg ernqf
vg, naq `EbhaqGevc` pybfrf vg, rira ba reebef. Gb fraq vg ntnva lbh zhfg unir xrcg n pbcl
(`TrgObql`, be n ohssre hc gb n fvmr yvzvg). Gung vf jung Raibl qbrf, jvgu n ohssre yvzvg.

Naq ergevrf zhygvcyl: guerr ynlref gung rnpu gel 3 gvzrf ghea bar hfre erdhrfg vagb 27 ng gur
obggbz qhevat na bhgntr. Urapr "bayl ba nabgure onpxraq, ng zbfg `ZnkErgevrf`", naq ergel ohqtrgf
va cebqhpgvba cebkvrf.

### Npgvir naq cnffvir urnygu

**Npgvir purpxf** nfx: "ner lbh ernql?" Gurl svaq n qrnq onpxraq orsber n hfre qbrf naq, zber
vzcbegnag, gurl abgvpr jura vg erpbiref. Gurve oyvaq fcbg: n onpxraq pna nafjre `/urnygum` jvgu
200 naq rirel erny erdhrfg jvgu 500.

**Cnffvir rwrpgvba** (Raibl pnyyf vg *bhgyvre qrgrpgvba*) jngpurf erny genssvp naq pngpurf
rknpgyl gung pnfr. Vgf oyvaq fcbg vf erpbirel. Na rwrpgrq onpxraq trgf ab genssvp, fb genssvp
pnaabg fubj gung vg vf svar ntnva. Gur nafjre vf gvzr: rwrpg sbe `RwrpgSbe`, gura yrg erny genssvp
cebor vg ntnva. Gung vf gur pvephvg oernxre sebz 14, cre onpxraq: Bcra sbe RwrpgSbe, gura erny
erdhrfgf ner gur unys-bcra ceborf. Rwrpgvba gvzr vf fgberq nf n cbvag va gvzr (`rwrpgrqHagvy`),
abg nf n gvzre: "inyhr ng gvzr g", nf jvgu gur gbxra ohpxrg va 08. Abguvat ehaf va gur onpxtebhaq,
naq gur snxr pybpx va gur grfgf pbagebyf vg pbzcyrgryl.

**Guerfubyqf tvir ulfgrerfvf.** Bar ybfg cnpxrg fubhyq abg erzbir n onpxraq, bar yhpxl fhpprff
fubhyq abg erfgber n oebxra bar. `HaurnygulNsgre` naq `UrnygulNsgre` pbhag *pbafrphgvir* erfhygf.
Rirel bccbfvgr erfhyg erfrgf gur fgernx. Jevgr vg nf gjb pbhagref, be nf bar fvtarq fgernx, ohg
grfg vg jvgu n frdhrapr yvxr gur ERNQZR'f, abg jvgu fvatyr purpxf.

### Jubfr snvyher vf vg?

Rirel snvyher lbh erpbeq zhfg or gur onpxraq'f snhyg. Pbagrkg pnapryyngvba vf gur pbzzba genc,
orpnhfr gur reebe ybbxf gur fnzr jubrire pnapryyrq:

- Va `FreirUGGC`, n genafcbeg reebe juvyr `e.Pbagrkg().Ree() != avy` zrnaf gur pyvrag yrsg. Qb abg
  pbhag vg, qb abg ergel vg.
- Va `PurpxUrnygu`, rnpu purpx unf vgf bja `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(pgk, UrnyguGvzrbhg)`. Vs *gung*
  qrnqyvar cnffrf, gur onpxraq jnf gbb fybj: n snvyher. Vs gur *bhgre* pgk vf qbar, gur YO vf
  fuhggvat qbja: vtaber gur erfhyg. Fb purpx gur bhgre `pgk.Ree()`, abg gur reebe lbh tbg;
  `reebef.Vf(ree, pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq)` pnaabg gryy gur gjb ncneg jura gur bhgre pgk unf n
  qrnqyvar gbb.

### Pbhagvat va syvtug, naq gur qenva enpr

`ngbzvp.Vag64` znxrf Ortva naq Raq fnsr. Rknpgarff nyfb arrqf gur evtug zbzragf: Ortva orsber gur
erdhrfg yrnirf, Raq jura ErirefrCebkl'f `FreirUGGC` unf erghearq (be cnavpxrq). N erdhrfg jubfr
urnqref unir neevirq ohg jubfr 2 TO obql vf fgvyy fgernzvat vf va syvtug. Vs Raq ehaf va
`ZbqvslErfcbafr`, Qenva ergheaf juvyr qbjaybnqf ner fgvyy ehaavat, naq gur erfgneg phgf gurz bss.

Qenva vgfrys vf n **purpx-gura-npg** ceboyrz:

```
erdhrfg tbebhgvar                 Qenva tbebhgvar
ryvtvoyr(o)? lrf
                                  qenvavat = gehr
                                  VaSyvtug() == 0 -> erghea, "fnsr gb erfgneg"
o.Ortva(); fraq gb o              (o vf orvat erfgnegrq)
```

Gur svk vf gb znxr "purpx ryvtvovyvgl naq pbhag vg" bar fgrc eryngvir gb Qenva. Jvgu n
`flap.EJZhgrk`: gur cvpx naq `Ortva` unccra haqre `EYbpx`, frggvat `qenvavat` unccraf haqre
`Ybpx`. Jura Qenva'f `Ybpx` ergheaf, rirel cvpx gung fnj gur byq synt unf nyernql pnyyrq Ortva,
naq rirel yngre cvpx frrf gur arj synt. Znal erdhrfgf fgvyy cvpx va cnenyyry, fvapr ernqref qb
abg oybpx rnpu bgure. N frpbaq pbeerpg qrfvta vf bcgvzvfgvp: `Ortva` svefg, gura er-purpx
ryvtvovyvgl haqre gur ybpx, naq vs gur onpxraq orpnzr varyvtvoyr, `Raq` naq cvpx ntnva. Obgu
cnff `GrfgQenvaJuvyrCvpxvat`; "purpx, haybpx, gura Ortva" qbrf abg.

Jnvgvat sbe mreb vf gur frpbaq cneg. Gur fvzcyrfg pbeerpg jnl vf gb cbyy: purpx gur pbhag, jnvg
sbe n fubeg gvpx be `pgk.Qbar()`, purpx ntnva. `uggc.Freire.Fuhgqbja` jnvgf sbe vgf pbaarpgvbaf
gur fnzr jnl (vg cbyyf, fgnegvat ng 1 zf naq onpxvat bss gb 500 zf). Abguvat arj pna ortva ba n
qenvavat onpxraq, fb gur pbhag bayl tbrf qbja, naq n cbyy pnaabg zvff gur 0.

N jnxr-hc punaary ybbxf avpre naq uvqrf n genc. Fnl `Raq` qbrf n aba-oybpxvat fraq ba n
punaary jvgu pncnpvgl 1 jura gur pbhag ernpurf 0, naq Qenva ybbcf "juvyr va syvtug > 0, jnvg sbe
gung punaary be `pgk.Qbar()`". Jvgu bar jnvgre gung vf pbeerpg: n fgnyr gbxra pbfgf bar rkgen
purpx, naq n gbxra frag orgjrra gur purpx naq gur jnvg fgnlf va gur ohssre. Jvgu gjb Qenvaf bs
gur fnzr onpxraq (n cerFgbc ubbx naq na bcrengbe), gur bar gbxra jnxrf bar bs gurz naq gur bgure
jnvgf sberire. Jnxvat rirel jnvgre arrqf n oebnqpnfg. Va Tb gung vf `pybfr(pu)`, jvgu n serfu
punaary, haqre n zhgrk, rnpu gvzr gur pbhag evfrf ntnva. `flap.Pbaq.Oebnqpnfg` jnxrf rirelbar
gbb, ohg lbh pnaabg `fryrpg` ba vg gbtrgure jvgu `pgk.Qbar()`. Sbe n jnvg bs frpbaqf, cbyyvat vf
fvzcyre. `GrfgQenvaGjvprNgBapr` purpxf gur gjb-jnvgre pnfr.

### Tbebhgvarf obhaq gb n pbagrkg

`EhaUrnyguPurpxf` oybpxf naq ergheaf bayl jura pgk vf qbar *naq* vgf ynfg ebhaq unf svavfurq, fb
gur pnyyre bjaf gur tbebhgvar naq pna jnvg sbe vg (nf va 12 naq 15). Fb pnyy `PurpxUrnygu` va
gung fnzr tbebhgvar. Jvgu `tb yo.PurpxUrnygu(pgk)` cre ebhaq, EhaUrnyguPurpxf ergheaf juvyr
purpxf fgvyy eha: n yrnx gung fubjf bayl jura n purpx vf fybj gb fgbc, juvpu vf jung
`GrfgUrnyguEhaJnvgfSbeEhaavatEbhaq` ohvyqf. Eha gur svefg ebhaq orsber gur svefg jnvg, fb n arj
YO xabjf vgf onpxraqf ng bapr. N `gvzr.Gvpxre` qebcf gvpxf jura n ebhaq vf fybjre guna gur
vagreiny, fb ebhaqf arire cvyr hc. `gvzr.Fyrrc` jbhyq vtaber pgk: pnapryyvat jvgu n 10 f
vagreiny jbhyq unat sbe hc gb 10 f.

Va `PurpxUrnygu`, bar tbebhgvar cre onpxraq cyhf n `flap.JnvgTebhc` tvirf "nyy ng gur fnzr gvzr,
erghea jura nyy ner qbar". Fvapr Tb 1.22 rnpu ybbc vgrengvba unf vgf bja `o`, fb `tb shap() {
... o ... }()` pncgherf gur evtug onpxraq. Ernq rnpu purpx'f erfcbafr obql gb gur raq naq pybfr
vg: vs vg vf pybfrq haernq, gur Genafcbeg pnaabg erhfr gur pbaarpgvba, naq rirel purpx bcraf n
arj bar.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Jevgvat n 502 va gur ReebeUnaqyre.** Gura gur erfcbafr unf fgnegrq naq ab ergel vf cbffvoyr.
- **`Raq` jvgubhg `qrsre`.** Gur `ReeNobegUnaqyre` cnavp fxvcf vg, gur pbhag fgnlf ng 1 sberire,
  naq rirel yngre Qenva bs gung onpxraq unatf.
- **Purpxvat ryvtvovyvgl naq pnyyvat `Ortva` nf gjb frcnengr fgrcf.** Qenva fyvcf va orgjrra naq
  ergheaf juvyr n erdhrfg vf ba vgf jnl gb gur onpxraq.
- **N pncnpvgl-1 jnxr-hc punaary sbe Qenva.** Vg jnxrf bar jnvgre; n frpbaq Qenva unatf.
- **Raqvat va-syvtug ng gur erfcbafr urnqref** (`ZbqvslErfcbafr`). Qenva gura phgf bss qbjaybnqf.
- **Ergelvat ba 5kk be ba CBFG.** Qhcyvpngr fvqr rssrpgf, naq rkgen ybnq ba gur onpxraqf gung
  fgvyy jbex.
- **Ergelvat n erdhrfg jvgu n obql.** Gur obql vf pbafhzrq naq pybfrq; gur ergel fraqf na
  rzcgl be oebxra erdhrfg.
- **Ergelvat gb gur fnzr onpxraq.** Vg ershfrq n zvyyvfrpbaq ntb, vg jvyy ershfr ntnva. Xrrc n
  `gevrq` yvfg cre erdhrfg.
- **Pbhagvat pyvrag pnapryyngvbaf be fuhgqbja nf onpxraq snvyherf.** Urnygul onpxraqf trg
  rwrpgrq qhevat rknpgyl gur vapvqragf jurer lbh arrq gurz.
- **Pnyyvat `Cvpx` zber guna bapr cre nggrzcg,** sbe rknzcyr bapr gb "crrx". Ebhaq ebova gura
  fxvcf onpxraqf.
- **Ubyqvat gur YO ybpx juvyr cebklvat** be juvyr n urnygu purpx ehaf. Rirel erdhrfg gura jnvgf
  sbe gur fybjrfg onpxraq. Ybpx bayl nebhaq ernqf naq jevgrf bs gur fgngr.
- **`abj.Nsgre(rwrpgrqHagvy)` sbe "ryvtvoyr".** Ng rknpgyl gur raq gvzr gung fnlf "fgvyy
  rwrpgrq". Gur grfgf purpx gung zbzrag. Hfr `!abj.Orsber(rwrpgrqHagvy)`.
- **Ab gvzrbhgf ba cebkvrq erdhrfgf.** Guvf YO unf abar: n onpxraq gung npprcgf naq arire nafjref
  ubyqf erdhrfgf sberire. Va cebqhpgvba, frg qvny naq `ErfcbafrUrnqreGvzrbhg` ba gur Genafcbeg.
- **Rwrpgvat rirelguvat.** Jvgu bar onq qrcybl ba nyy onpxraqf, cnffvir rwrpgvba gheaf "reebef"
  vagb "503 sbe rirelbar". Frr gur cnavp guerfubyq orybj.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Raibl.** Urnygu purpxvat jvgu `vagreiny`, `gvzrbhg`, `haurnygul_guerfubyq` naq
  `urnygul_guerfubyq`. Bhgyvre qrgrpgvba jvgu `pbafrphgvir_5kk` (qrsnhyg 5) naq
  `onfr_rwrpgvba_gvzr` (qrsnhyg 30 f); gur rwrpgvba gvzr tebjf jvgu rnpu ercrngrq rwrpgvba, naq
  `znk_rwrpgvba_creprag` (qrsnhyg 10 %) yvzvgf ubj znal ubfgf pna or rwrpgrq. N *cnavp guerfubyq*
  (qrsnhyg 50 %): jura gbb srj ubfgf ner urnygul, Raibl onynaprf bire nyy bs gurz. Ergevrf ner
  bcg-va cre ebhgr jvgu `ergel_ba` pbaqvgvbaf fhpu nf `pbaarpg-snvyher`, `erfrg` naq `5kk`, naq
  pna or pnccrq jvgu ergel ohqtrgf. `YRNFG_ERDHRFG` hfrf gjb enaqbz pubvprf ol qrsnhyg jura nyy
  ubfgf unir gur fnzr jrvtug.
- **ATVAK.** Cnffvir bayl va gur bcra-fbhepr irefvba: `znk_snvyf` (qrsnhyg 1) snvyherf jvguva
  `snvy_gvzrbhg` (qrsnhyg 10 f) znex n freire haninvynoyr sbe `snvy_gvzrbhg`.
  `cebkl_arkg_hcfgernz` (qrsnhyg `reebe gvzrbhg`) qrpvqrf juvpu snvyherf tb gb gur arkg freire;
  aba-vqrzcbgrag zrgubqf ner abg cnffrq ba bapr gur erdhrfg jnf frag, hayrff lbh nqq
  `aba_vqrzcbgrag`. Npgvir `urnygu_purpx` vf na ATVAK Cyhf srngher.
- **UNCebkl.** `purpx` jvgu `vagre` (qrsnhyg 2 f), `snyy` (3) naq `evfr` (2): gur fnzr guerfubyqf
  nf HaurnygulNsgre naq UrnygulNsgre.
- **Xhoreargrf.** xhor-cebkl qbrf abg cebor gur onpxraqf vgfrys. Gur xhoryrg ehaf gur ernqvarff
  cebor (UGGC: 200 gb 399 cnffrf; qrsnhygf `crevbqFrpbaqf: 10`, `snvyherGuerfubyq: 3`), naq n cbq
  gung vf abg ernql vf znexrq fb va gur RaqcbvagFyvprf, fb rirel cebkl fgbcf fraqvat gb vg. N
  qryrgrq cbq'f raqcbvag gheaf grezvangvat juvyr gur pbagnvare fgvyy ehaf; n `cerFgbc` fyrrc
  xrrcf vg freivat hagvy rirel cebkl unf pnhtug hc. Gung vf Qenva, fcernq bire n pyhfgre.
- **Tbbtyr FER obbx.** Onpxraqf va *ynzr qhpx* fgngr fgvyy freir ohg nfx pyvragf gb fgbc fraqvat
  arj erdhrfgf: gur onpxraq fvqr bs Qenva. Gur puncgre nyfb pbiref jrvtugrq ebhaq ebova naq
  fhofrggvat.

